{"id":"n64372-1-9","stage":3,"title":"내려다보다 · 俯视","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64372-1-9-1","ko":"여기에서는 학교가 잘 안 보여.","zh":"从这里看不太清楚学校的样子。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기에서는","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"학교가","meaning":"学校","explanation":"학교：学校；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73276","senseId":"1","lemma":"학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"清楚地，仔细地","explanation":"잘：清楚地，仔细地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"2","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보여.","meaning":"可见，看得到","explanation":"보이다：可见，看得到；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"3","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"f7b9c878ccca829a","term":"학교","zh":"学校","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3","entryId":"73276","definition":"按照一定的目标、教育课程、制度等，教师对学生进行教育的机构。","pronunciation":["학꾜"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"清楚地，仔细地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"分明而准确地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"可见，看得到","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"某种结果出来。","pronunciation":["보이다"]}],"audio":"/audio/83cf4814033f4439f6b1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64372-1-9-2","ko":"옥상에 올라가서 내려다보면 보일 거야.","zh":"只要上到屋顶往下看，就能看到了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"옥상에","meaning":"屋顶，房顶，屋顶平台","explanation":"옥상：屋顶，房顶，屋顶平台；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"옥상","audio":"/audio/eebd6ed03c8fe3edca33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22046","senseId":"1","lemma":"옥상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"올라가서","meaning":"上，上去","explanation":"올라가다：上，上去；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"올라가다","audio":"/audio/bfc58fbbb2f7632503c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89867","senseId":"1","lemma":"올라가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내려다보면","meaning":"俯视，俯瞰","explanation":"내려다보다：俯视，俯瞰；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"내려다보다","audio":"/audio/5d3a414e57deae6683f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64372","senseId":"1","lemma":"내려다보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보일","meaning":"可见，看得到","explanation":"보이다：可见，看得到；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"3","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"eebd6ed03c8fe3ed","term":"옥상","zh":"屋顶，房顶，屋顶平台","audio":"/audio/eebd6ed03c8fe3edca33.mp3","entryId":"22046","definition":"在现代式的建筑中，为能利用而把屋顶建成平面的地方。","pronunciation":["옥쌍"]},{"id":"bfc58fbbb2f76325","term":"올라가다","zh":"上，上去","audio":"/audio/bfc58fbbb2f7632503c1.mp3","entryId":"89867","definition":"从下向上，从低处前往高处。","pronunciation":["올라가다"]},{"id":"5d3a414e57deae66","term":"내려다보다","zh":"俯视，俯瞰","audio":"/audio/5d3a414e57deae6683f3.mp3","entryId":"64372","definition":"由上往下看。","pronunciation":["내려다보다"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"可见，看得到","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"某种结果出来。","pronunciation":["보이다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/ae320ef37faa42993d41.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.773,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=64372","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":93,"sequenceScore":2.4983,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["从这里看不太清楚学校的样子。","只要上到屋顶往下看，就能看到了。","你的黑色眼眸，比天上的月亮和星星还要美丽动人呢。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["从这里看不太清楚学校的样子。","只要上到屋顶往下看，就能看到了。","你的黑色眼眸，比天上的月亮和星星还要美丽动人呢。"],"answer":1}]}
